<!--
  Vietnamese (vi) for :feature:notification. Mirrors values/strings.xml key for key.

  WORDING RULES apply to every string in this file, not only to the English originals: no claim about
  removing viruses, blocking scams, speeding a phone up or freeing memory, and no performance
  percentage. A measured number is reported with its unit; what the number will do for the user is
  never asserted.

  PLURALS — Vietnamese has ONE CLDR plural category, `other`. Note these two carry %d, not %1$d, so
  the Vietnamese bodies keep the unpositioned form to match.
-->
